{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54036","headline":"功勳五位颂（原注：本则既已出上。异本作「上堂次示问话僧颂」） 五 · 良价","name":"功勳五位颂（原注：本则既已出上。异本作「上堂次示问话僧颂」） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"头角才生已不堪，拟心求佛好羞惭。\n迟迟空劫无人识，肯向南訽五十三。\n（功功）（按：《五灯会元》卷十三所收连作一首。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"良价","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54036.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54036","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}